# Root build context is now the repo root for BOTH webapp and backend (both need /packages/*).
# Keep the context small and avoid copying host deps/artifacts (rebuilt inside the image).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.nuxt
**/coverage
**/*.log
.git
.github
# Local test/build artifacts. These reached the images purely because they were sitting in a working
# copy — packages/ui/storybook-static alone was 7 MB of the webapp production image.
**/storybook-static
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
